#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:214 8dc06dce1162478596b412f7c0bc47d6
msgid ""
"Load the entire audio file as a sample into memory. This allows for faster playback and lower CPU"
" usage, but consumes more memory. Best suited for short sound effects."
msgstr "将整个音频文件作为样本加载到内存中。这可以实现更快的播放和更低的 CPU 使用率，但会消耗更多内存。最适合短音效使用"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:220 3952eca530354eaca62b9e4aa35b9a2f
msgid ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_LOOP** = ``4``"
msgstr ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_LOOP** = ``4``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:222 82808fe893c5490196bc07e3eef93532
msgid "Enable normal loop playback. When the audio reaches the end, it will loop back to the beginning."
msgstr "启用正常循环播放。当音频播放到末尾时，它会回到开头重新播放"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:228 ab8ace2ca2394f90b122a29755aa8ac1
msgid ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_LOOP_BIDI** = ``8``"
msgstr ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_LOOP_BIDI** = ``8``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:230 4d17f44fba5844d89bcba1b0f3b1a738
msgid ""
"Enable bidirectional (ping-pong) loop playback. When the audio reaches the end, it will play "
"backwards to the beginning, then forwards again, creating a seamless back-and-forth loop."
msgstr "启用双向（乒乓）循环播放。当音频播放到末尾时，它会向后播放到开始位置，然后再次向前播放，创建一个无缝的来回循环"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:236 d7128319df8a4110bc7a7a0ae477e4a8
msgid ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_2D** = ``16``"
msgstr ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_2D** = ``16``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:238 0882c0f59f3e473ab0d6b41785708fd3
msgid "Force 2D mode, disabling all 3D processing for this sound."
msgstr "强制使用二维模式，关闭该声音的所有三维处理。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:240 b3c5cd58acde47769902da7a81ef276a
msgid ""
"When set, the sound will play without any 3D spatial positioning, distance attenuation, or "
"doppler effects."
msgstr "关闭三维定位、距离衰减和多普勒效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:242 32c9482763444104892c111404394f27
msgid "This is useful for UI sounds, background music, or when using custom 2D audio positioning."
msgstr "适合界面音效、背景音乐或自定义二维音频定位。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:248 2bba14dc4df9492aa767ddcd05191399
msgid ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_3D** = ``32``"
msgstr ":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` **MODE_3D** = ``32``"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:250 69c632d502804482bcca46854dacc0f6
msgid "Force 3D mode, enabling 3D spatial processing for this sound."
msgstr "强制使用三维模式，启用该声音的三维空间处理。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:252 f36affa23d56447bbc5a93efbada7815
msgid ""
"When set, the sound will be processed with 3D positioning, distance attenuation, and other "
"spatial effects."
msgstr "声音将进行三维定位、距离衰减和其他空间处理。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:254 282d63d67e3d46cf90dfb1d8ca6b380b
msgid "This is the default for 3D audio sources."
msgstr "三维音源默认使用此模式。"

