#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:293 5fb96670c1a841ab9be430a8173054f2
msgid ""
"The raw audio data loaded from file. This is typically set by the audio importer or by "
":ref:`load_from_file()<class_FmodAudioStream_method_load_from_file>`. The data is stored in "
"memory and used to create the FMOD sound object when "
":ref:`get_sound()<class_FmodAudioStream_method_get_sound>` is called."
msgstr ""
"从文件加载的原始音频数据。通常由音频导入器或通过    :ref:`load_from_file()<class_FmodAudioStream_method_load_from_file>`"
"    设置。数据存储在内存中，并在调用    :ref:`get_sound()<class_FmodAudioStream_method_get_sound>`    时用于创建 FMOD "
"声音对象"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:295 4dbaf30417ba41bd880408f0a38745d5
msgid ""
"**Note:** The returned array is *copied* and any changes to it will not update the original "
"property value. See :ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"从文件加载的原始音频数据。通常由音频导入器或通过    ``load_from_file()``    设置。数据存储在内存中，并在调用    ``get_sound()``    时用于创建 "
"FMOD 声音对象 （参见   :ref:`PackedByteArray<class_PackedByteArray>`  ）"

