#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:312 d3543833694e4cf49d2c3b0007cc532c
msgid ""
"Creation mode flags that determine how the audio is loaded and played. This is a bitmask of "
":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>` values. When these flags are changed, the "
"internal :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>` is released and will be recreated with the new flags "
"on the next call to :ref:`get_sound()<class_FmodAudioStream_method_get_sound>`."
msgstr ""
"创建模式标志，用于确定音频的加载和播放方式。这是    :ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>`    "
"值的位掩码。当这些标志被更改时，内部的    :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`    会被释放，并将在下一次调用    "
":ref:`get_sound()<class_FmodAudioStream_method_get_sound>`    时使用新的标志重新创建"

