#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:1071 b23d5437995c4003aa76930b15378e32
msgid ""
"Returns the :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>` object for this stream, creating it if necessary "
"(lazy creation). The sound is created using the current "
":ref:`mode_flags<class_FmodAudioStream_property_mode_flags>` settings. If the mode flags have "
"changed since the last call, the sound will be recreated with the new settings."
