#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:1087 d63f8a0d6f8a41a9bdafac44bf3201dc
msgid ""
"Creates the internal :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>` immediately using the current "
":ref:`mode_flags<class_FmodAudioStream_property_mode_flags>`."
msgstr ""
"立即创建并缓存内部    :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`   ，用于减少首次播放时的延迟。创建成功返回    ``true``   。 （参见   "
":ref:`mode_flags<class_FmodAudioStream_property_mode_flags>`  ）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:1089 06a3a26c676243bfbc077373f5661e42
msgid ""
"Use this before playback to move FMOD sound creation and stream prebuffering out of the first "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer.play()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_method_play>` call."
msgstr ""
"播放前调用，可提前完成 FMOD 声音创建和流预缓冲，减少首次    "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer.play()<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer_method_play>`    的工作量。"

