msgid ""
"Clears the audio data and releases the internal :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>` resource. This "
"frees up memory and resets the stream to an empty state. The stream will need to be reloaded "
"before it can be played again."
msgstr "清除音频数据并释放内部    :ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`    资源。这将释放内存并将流重置为空状态。"

