#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:194 c835cec0f31a42efa20c09849d582c9f
msgid ""
"With no flags set, creates a non-looping 2D sample. The resource property default is "
":ref:`MODE_STREAM<class_FmodAudioStream_constant_MODE_STREAM>`."
msgstr ""
"未设置标志时创建不循环的 2D 采样音频。资源属性的默认值为  "
":ref:`MODE_STREAM<class_FmodAudioStream_constant_MODE_STREAM>` \\ 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:202 3069add9af1f4a3196faa2f226308cea
msgid ""
"Decodes the in-memory audio data progressively. The complete source file remains in "
":ref:`audio_data<class_FmodAudioStream_property_audio_data>`; streaming avoids decoding the "
"entire sound into PCM at creation time."
msgstr ""
"逐步解码内存中的音频数据。完整源文件仍保存在  :ref:`audio_data<class_FmodAudioStream_property_audio_data>`  "
"中；流式模式避免在创建声音时将整段音频解码为 PCM。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:327 616600b126c64989af924c49f668f9d0
msgid ""
"Optional byte length passed to FMOD, clamped to the size of "
":ref:`audio_data<class_FmodAudioStream_property_audio_data>`. A value of ``0`` uses the "
"complete data size."
msgstr ""
"传递给 FMOD 的可选字节长度，上限为  :ref:`audio_data<class_FmodAudioStream_property_audio_data>`  的大小。\\  "
"``0``  表示使用全部数据。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:1135 f7ab0c86a50141618b3994b0bdeb89c6
msgid ""
"Reads the entire file at ``path`` into "
":ref:`audio_data<class_FmodAudioStream_property_audio_data>` and returns a new stream. "
"Resource paths and absolute file paths are supported."
msgstr ""
"读取  ``path``  指定文件的全部内容到  :ref:`audio_data<class_FmodAudioStream_property_audio_data>` \\ "
"，并返回新的音频流。支持资源路径和绝对文件路径。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:1137 0ab10c11d5ee4b00be0459e81648bbe2
msgid ""
"\\ ``flags`` controls FMOD decoding and playback using "
":ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>`. The default "
":ref:`MODE_STREAM<class_FmodAudioStream_constant_MODE_STREAM>` streams decoding from the in-"
"memory data, not directly from disk."
msgstr ""
"``flags``  通过  :ref:`CreateMode<enum_FmodAudioStream_CreateMode>`  控制 FMOD 的解码和播放。默认的  "
":ref:`MODE_STREAM<class_FmodAudioStream_constant_MODE_STREAM>`  从内存中的数据流式解码，不会直接从磁盘流式读取。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiostream.rst:1139 f0a1e811fd0b46f9b8d36a8c087bcbf8
msgid "Returns ``null`` if the file cannot be opened or contains no readable data."
msgstr "无法打开文件或没有可读取的数据时返回  ``null`` \\ 。"
